message: "Please cite this version 4 computational supplement, the associated manuscript version, and the full repository commit used. The same software supports manuscript v4.2 Final (45 pages, 29 references); Appendix F.4 is analytical and is not part of the numerical checks."
type: software
title: "Dimensional Accessibility and Gravitational Localization: Spectral Response, Boundary Stability, and Constitutive Constraints in TCGS-SEQUENTION — Computational Supplement"
